# The Ultimate Doom E2M9 (M9): from the map's start, no monsters: the player walks to the exit,
# through the doors on the way (and the keys they need), and leaves the level, the last
# tic. Written by tools/RouteGen (doom-e2m9-walk-exit).
iwad doom
map E2M9
exit normal
